<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sunday's Scottish</p>
<p>premier division soccer match:</p>
<p>Aberdeen 0 Rangers 3 (Robertson 38, Laudrup 77, Miller 86).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1. Attendance 21,500.</p>
